---
// Drei Top-Features mit Mini-Visuals.
---

<section class="features section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="features-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Was ScriptZ besonders macht</span>
      <h2 class="h-section">Drei Sachen, die du sofort merken wirst.</h2>
      <p class="lead features-lead">
        Es gibt natürlich noch viel mehr in der App. Aber das hier
        sind die drei Dinge, die wir am meisten vermisst haben.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <article class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-visual feature-visual-format" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="fmt-paper">
            <div class="fmt-line fmt-action">Café am Morgen.</div>
            <div class="fmt-line fmt-character">LINA</div>
            <div class="fmt-line fmt-dialog">Ist hier noch frei?</div>
            <div class="fmt-line fmt-character">BEN</div>
            <div class="fmt-line fmt-parenthetical">(ohne aufzusehen)</div>
            <div class="fmt-line fmt-dialog">Klar.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="fmt-keys" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="fmt-key">⌘1</span>
            <span class="fmt-key">⌘2</span>
            <span class="fmt-key">⌘3</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-body">
          <h3 class="h-card">Formatierung, die du vergessen kannst.</h3>
          <p class="feature-text">
            Charakternamen werden zentriert und großgeschrieben.
            Dialog rückt ein. Klammern werden zu Regieanweisungen.
            Das alles passiert von selbst, während du tippst.
            Ein Tastendruck wechselt den Block-Typ. Du denkst an
            die Geschichte, ScriptZ kümmert sich um die Form.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-visual feature-visual-local" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="local-mac">
            <div class="local-screen">
              <div class="local-dot"></div>
              <div class="local-dot"></div>
              <div class="local-dot"></div>
              <div class="local-script">
                <div class="local-line w-80"></div>
                <div class="local-line w-50"></div>
                <div class="local-line w-90"></div>
                <div class="local-line w-65"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="local-base"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="local-cloud" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="local-cloud-text">Cloud</span>
            <span class="local-cloud-x">×</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-body">
          <h3 class="h-card">Lokal. Komplett.</h3>
          <p class="feature-text">
            Aktuell ohne Konto, ohne Login. Deine Skripte liegen als
            eine SQLite-Datei auf deinem Mac. Funktioniert im
            Flugzeug, im Café ohne WLAN, überall. Optionale
            Synchronisierung kommt irgendwann später, wenn du sie
            möchtest.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="feature reveal">
        <div class="feature-visual feature-visual-search" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="search-bar">
            <span class="search-kbd">⌘K</span>
            <span class="search-input">Coffee Shop</span>
            <span class="search-cursor"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="search-results">
            <div class="search-result is-active">
              <span class="search-result-title">
                <mark>Coffee Shop</mark> Chaos
              </span>
              <span class="search-result-meta">heute</span>
            </div>
            <div class="search-result">
              <span class="search-result-title">
                Im <mark>Coffee Shop</mark> wartet Lina...
              </span>
              <span class="search-result-meta">vorgestern</span>
            </div>
            <div class="search-result">
              <span class="search-result-title">
                Skript Nr. 412 - <mark>Coffee</mark>-Pun
              </span>
              <span class="search-result-meta">letzte Woche</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-body">
          <h3 class="h-card">Alles in Millisekunden finden.</h3>
          <p class="feature-text">
            Ein Tastendruck und du suchst durch alle deine Skripte
            auf einmal. Funktioniert auch bei tausend Skripten so
            schnell, als wäre es das erste. Tabs oben halten
            mehrere Skripte parallel offen, Browser-Style.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features-head {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-10);
  }
  .features-lead {
    margin: var(--sp-4) auto 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--sp-5);
  }

  .feature {
    background: var(--bg-elev-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--r-5);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform var(--t-med), box-shadow var(--t-med), border-color var(--t-med);
  }
  .feature:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--border-strong);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .feature-visual {
    height: 200px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-elev-2) 0%, var(--bg-elev-3) 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: var(--sp-5);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .feature-body {
    padding: var(--sp-6) var(--sp-6) var(--sp-7);
  }
  .feature-text {
    margin-top: var(--sp-3);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-15);
    line-height: var(--lh-relaxed);
  }

  /* ---- Visual 1: Automatische Formatierung ----
     Mini-Paper-Sheet (analog zum Mac-Screen in Visual 2) mit dem
     fertig formatierten Skript drin. Tasten-Keys schweben unten
     halb hinter dem Paper, deuten den Block-Typ-Wechsel an. */
  .feature-visual-format {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
    padding: var(--sp-4);
    position: relative;
  }
  .fmt-paper {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-paper);
    padding: 14px 20px 16px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 240px;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #1c1814;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .fmt-line {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .fmt-action {
    text-align: left;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.7);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .fmt-character {
    text-align: center;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .fmt-character:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
  .fmt-dialog {
    text-align: left;
    margin-left: 16%;
    margin-right: 16%;
  }
  .fmt-parenthetical {
    text-align: left;
    margin-left: 22%;
    margin-right: 22%;
    font-style: italic;
    color: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.65);
  }

  /* Schwebende Tasten-Keys, leicht unter das Paper schiebend */
  .fmt-keys {
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 14px;
    right: 18px;
    z-index: 2;
  }
  .fmt-key {
    background: var(--bg-elev-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-bottom-width: 2px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    line-height: 1.3;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.06);
  }

  /* ---- Visual 2: Lokal ---- */
  .feature-visual-local {
    position: relative;
  }
  .local-mac {
    width: 200px;
    transform: translateY(-6px);
  }
  .local-screen {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 10px 10px 6px 6px;
    height: 130px;
    padding: 12px;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-paper);
  }
  .local-dot {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--fg-faint);
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 4px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .local-dot:first-child { background: #ed6a5e; }
  .local-dot:nth-child(2) { background: #f5be4f; }
  .local-dot:nth-child(3) { background: #61c554; }

  .local-script {
    margin-top: 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .local-line {
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.10);
  }
  .local-line.w-80 { width: 80%; }
  .local-line.w-50 { width: 50%; background: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.16); }
  .local-line.w-90 { width: 90%; }
  .local-line.w-65 { width: 65%; background: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.22); }

  .local-base {
    height: 8px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d4cdb9 0%, #a8a293 100%);
    border-radius: 0 0 16px 16px;
    margin: 0 -10px;
  }
  .local-cloud {
    position: absolute;
    top: 16px;
    right: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-elev-1);
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--r-pill);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: var(--fs-12);
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    transform: rotate(8deg);
  }
  .local-cloud-x {
    color: #c44a4a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* ---- Visual 3: Suche ---- */
  .feature-visual-search {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: var(--sp-3);
    padding: var(--sp-4) var(--sp-5);
  }
  .search-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-paper);
  }
  .search-kbd {
    background: var(--bg-elev-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    font-size: var(--fs-12);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .search-input {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-size: var(--fs-14);
  }
  .search-cursor {
    width: 1.5px;
    height: 14px;
    background: var(--fg);
    animation: blink-search 1.05s steps(2, end) infinite;
  }
  @keyframes blink-search {
    50% { opacity: 0; }
  }

  .search-results {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1px;
  }
  .search-result {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-size: var(--fs-12);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom-width: 0;
  }
  .search-result:first-child {
    border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
  }
  .search-result:last-child {
    border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px;
    border-bottom-width: 1px;
  }
  .search-result.is-active {
    background: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.04);
  }
  .search-result-title { color: var(--fg); }
  .search-result-title mark {
    background: rgba(28, 24, 20, 0.14);
    padding: 1px 3px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .search-result-meta {
    color: var(--fg-faint);
    font-size: var(--fs-11);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .features-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--sp-4);
    }
    .feature-visual { height: 180px; }
  }
</style>
